# Legacy "Quick Phrase" Feature — Complete Map

Repo root: `/testbed`. All paths below are absolute.

## 1. Renderer QuickPhraseService, Dexie store, and QuickPhrase type

### Service: `/testbed/src/renderer/src/services/QuickPhraseService.ts`
Full Dexie-backed CRUD service (init/getAll/add/update/delete/updateOrder). Uses `db.quick_phrases` and sorts by `order` descending. Key excerpts:

```ts
export class QuickPhraseService {
  private static _isInitialized: boolean = false

  static async init() { ... await db.open() ... }

  static async getAll(): Promise<QuickPhrase[]> {
    await QuickPhraseService.init()
    const phrases = await db.quick_phrases.toArray()
    return phrases.sort((a, b) => (b.order ?? 0) - (a.order ?? 0))
  }

  static async add(data: Pick<QuickPhrase, 'title' | 'content'>): Promise<QuickPhrase> {
    // increments every existing row's `order`, then inserts new phrase with order: 0
    const phrase: QuickPhrase = { id: uuidv4(), title, content, createdAt: now, updatedAt: now, order: 0 }
    await db.quick_phrases.add(phrase)
    return phrase
  }

  static async update(id, data) { await db.quick_phrases.update(id, { ...data, updatedAt: Date.now() }) }
  static async delete(id) { /* delete then re-sequence order */ }
  static async updateOrder(phrases) { /* rewrite order as length-1-index */ }
}
export default QuickPhraseService
```

### Dexie store definition: `/testbed/src/renderer/src/databases/index.ts`
